<title>USA: USLIFE Corp Q4 net declines.</title>
<headline>USLIFE Corp Q4 net declines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.77		    $0.81</p>
<p> Net		 26,859		   28,314</p>
<p> Revs		459,036		  444,974</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $2.18		    $3.03</p>
<p> Net		 76,207		   105,414</p>
<p> Revs		1,806,109		1,739,552</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  34,877		   34,811</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is USLIFE Corp.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 results include a $0.08 per share loss for capital losses; Q4 1995 results include capital gains of $0.03 per share.</p>
<p>Full-year 1996 results include one-time charges and capital losses totaling $0.09 per share, while full-year 1995 results include capital gains equal to $0.12 per share.</p>
